  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3207.05 Transfer Completion",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3207.05 Transfer Completion. A transfer shall be complete when the NATS administrator has verified that:\n\n(a) Each allowance listed in the transfer request is held by the originating account at the time the transfer was recorded;\n\n(b) The acquiring party has an account in the NATS; and\n\n(c) The transfer request has been filed by the person named as AAR for the originating account.\n\nSource. #11001, eff 1-1-16; ss by #14632, eff 6-25-26, EXPIRES: 6-25-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a3200.html"
}
